\textbf{Considerations for layer skipping in autoregressive models}

\begin{itemize}
    \item{Generation output is sensitive to errors introduced upon reducing computation for a single token.}
    \item{Evaluating layer-level classification heads are costly.}
    \item{Add routers at a token level adds overhead over autoregressive passes. So they need to be lightweight.}
\end{itemize}

